                "text": "\ud83d\ude91 MEDICAL FACTS DON\u2019T MATCH THE NARRATIVE\n\nThree doctors, three stories\u2014 yet none testified in court.\n\n1.Dr. Loffredo treated Megan first, diagnosed a laceration from broken glass, and filed an official police report. Zero mention of gunshot wounds, bullet fragments, or ballistic trauma.\n\n2.Dr. Little performed surgery 12 hours later, claimed to remove three major fragments, and diagnosed superficial gunshot wounds\u2014yet never reported his findings to law enforcement.\n\n3.Dr. Howell, a plastic surgeon, described the wounds as superficial and cleanly closed. She treated Megan for infection, discharged her without mentioning ballistic trauma.\n\nSo which is it?\n\nThe medical evidence is inconsistent, incomplete, and selectively presented.",
